---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          COMPLETE MARKETING AUTOMATION FOR ECOMMERCE AND RETAILERS
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-white text-3xl xl:text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
          Intelligent Workflows with Effective Results for Salesforce 
        </h2>
        <h3 class="font-normal text-xl xl:text-2xl mt-4 text-vulcan-300 ">
            Develop AI-driven workflows to enhance user engagement, retention, and acquisition. Expand your store and increase revenue through automated loyalty marketing strategies
        </br>
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover w-full -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.png"
          alt="Workflows for salesforce gift cards and loyalty program"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
Seamlessly integrate your salesforce store with leading eCommerce platforms and related apps, enabling more customized workflows. Effortlessly craft impactful and streamlined experiences at each point of the customer journey, all with just a few clicks.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
Design customized workflows to deploy advanced, data-centric marketing campaigns. Effortlessly blend features such as Salesforce store credit, coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into detailed workflows crafted to attract, convert, and retain customers. </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
Design fully automated, data-driven campaigns that are custom-tailored for your customers. Offer personalized incentives based on each customer's activities and profile, including rewards, cash backs, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, store credits, and more, to enhance engagement and loyalty.</div>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
